          "author": "mahesh alluri",
          "author_reviews_count": 1,
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "Lasya Grand , A Party Hall for 180-200 people in Ongole.\n\nCooL Central AC❄️, Very Good Audio systems 🎤🎵\n\nGrand Decorations , Clean and Spacious Green/make-up Rooms and Ample Car Parking.\n\nVery Tasty 😋 Scrumptious Food . We have booked for 180 guests and 250 turned out. Amazing well trained Staff they re-organized very well in a quick time to serve for 250 guests... Thanks a lot 🙏\n\nAwesome Decoration, Flexible Menu , Reasonable Price , Polite Staff and Elegant Ambience ... A good Banquet for 50 to 300 people.\n\nI am very Happy and I recommend Lasya Grand Banquet Hall in Ongole.\n\nLasya Grand Restaurant is spacious, staff courteous and food very tasty ... Well maintained family restaurant. Had a memorable time ... 🍲🥗🥙🧆🍨😋😋",
