        {
          "author": "Suneel Krishna",
          "author_reviews_count": 4,
          "rating": 5,
          "text": "I recently celebrated my daughter's birthday party at Lasya Grand restaurant and had an exceptional experience. They have arranged all facilities with in less than 6 hours notice. I am amazed to see such all in one restaurant in Ongole.\n\nThe restaurant also boasts a spacious party hall, perfect for hosting events of varying sizes. I was impressed by their ability to make quick arrangements on short notice, showcasing their commitment to customer satisfaction.They have various party places which can accommodate from 25 to 200 people.\n\nThe food was incredibly delicious, offering a delightful blend of flavors that left my taste buds craving more. The ambience was excellent, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere for a pleasant meal.\n\nThe staff was not only attentive but also courteous, enhancing the overall dining experience. What pleasantly surprised me was the affordability of the menu, considering the high-quality dishes served.\n\nMoreover, the option for decoration services added a personalized touch to events. Overall, this place is a gem, offering not just delicious food but also a wonderful ambiance, friendly staff, and convenient event hosting options. Highly recommended!",
